    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Take your friends along for the ride and make the road a safer place. Wheels With Friends combats the growing issue of distracted driving head on by using a driving game to train users to develop safe driving habits.  The variety of games and modes keep the users engaged and invested in the games and subsequently more focused on the act of driving.",
